<title>JAPAN: Moody's rates Chugoku Electric bonds Aa1.</title>
<headline>Moody's rates Chugoku Electric bonds Aa1.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday that it had assigned an Aa1 rating to Chugoku Electric Power Co Inc's 300 million mark 5.625 percent bonds due 2003.</p>
<p>It also said it had assigned the same Aa1 rating to Chugoku Electric Power Co Inc's $250 million 6.250 percent Eurobonds due 2001.</p>
</text>
